      "required_age": 0,
      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Drifter Star: Evolution&quot; - The Path from Stardust to Galactic Sovereignty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique cosmic evolution game, you will embark on an epic journey across time and space:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a tiny asteroid and continuously grow by devouring surrounding cosmic matter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve through collisions and consumption, progressing through different forms like planets, stars, and black holes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make critical choices at each evolutionary stage to shape your unique celestial body</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Growth System</strong> - Real-time devouring, instant evolution, experience the thrill of power growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Evolution Tree</strong> - Choose different evolutionary paths: Frozen Fortress, Cradle of Life, or War Planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger Meets Opportunity</strong> - Carefully avoid larger celestial bodies while seizing growth chances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Cosmic Landscapes</strong> - Experience visual impact from asteroid belts to galaxy clusters as scales change</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Objectives:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wisely select consumption targets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop long-term evolutionary strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance risks and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously ascend the cosmic food chain</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to become the master of the universe? Begin your devouring evolution journey and uncover the ultimate mysteries of the cosmos!</p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Drifter Star: Evolution&quot; - The Path from Stardust to Galactic Sovereignty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique cosmic evolution game, you will embark on an epic journey across time and space:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a tiny asteroid and continuously grow by devouring surrounding cosmic matter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve through collisions and consumption, progressing through different forms like planets, stars, and black holes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make critical choices at each evolutionary stage to shape your unique celestial body</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Growth System</strong> - Real-time devouring, instant evolution, experience the thrill of power growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Evolution Tree</strong> - Choose different evolutionary paths: Frozen Fortress, Cradle of Life, or War Planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danger Meets Opportunity</strong> - Carefully avoid larger celestial bodies while seizing growth chances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Cosmic Landscapes</strong> - Experience visual impact from asteroid belts to galaxy clusters as scales change</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Objectives:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wisely select consumption targets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop long-term evolutionary strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance risks and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously ascend the cosmic food chain</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to become the master of the universe? Begin your devouring evolution journey and uncover the ultimate mysteries of the cosmos!</p>",
      "short_description": "From stardust to cosmic sovereign! In this unique space game, evolve by devouring everything. Grow from a tiny rock into a massive galaxy. Each swallow brings growth, each evolution brings victory. Unlock the universe's ultimate secrets!",
